telemetry-plot

Draws one PNG per channel from a telemetry dump. Post-fire review only, not for the console.

  ./plot.py -i dump.csv -o out/ -c chamber_p,thrust

Each channel becomes out/<channel>.png with the time axis in seconds from ignition and the
redlines from doc/channels.txt drawn in.

Dump format

  time_ms,channel,value

One sample per line. Samples are sorted by time before plotting, gaps are interpolated linearly
and marked with a dashed segment so nobody mistakes them for data.

Layout

  plot/read.py     parse the dump, drop unknown channels
  plot/render.py   axis, redlines, dashed gaps
  plot/cli.py      argument handling
  doc/channels.txt channel list with units and limits
  tests/           small dumps with expected sizes
- usage
- dump format
- layout
- review only, not the console
